+- Files you changed, with any shared or non-search files marked.
+- Final result for `search.test.js` (all 3 runs) and the full suite, as pass/fail counts. If other files fail, say whether they also failed before your change.
+- Anything you weren't sure about, or left unfixed, and why.
+
+---
+
+## After they return
+
+1. Compare the three lists of changed files. If two agents changed the same shared file, merge those changes by hand before anything else.
+2. Merge the three worktrees and run the full suite once on the combined result.
+3. Before accepting any change to a test file, read it to confirm the test was actually wrong and the agent didn't just make the test easier to pass.
